      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Good idea, but I would solve it differently, sometimes I would like to group all my plugins into those I use constantly and those I use once a year, but I don't want to remove them from VCC, every time I go to the plugin edit view, it annoys me that I see one big trash instead of what I need specifically, some repositories don't add one thing to the list and instead there are e.g. 20 of them.\n\nA better solution would be the ability to simply create presets with plugins that we use and the ability to apply the entire preset at once, and the ability to display only things from a given group instead of one big list of plugins.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
